{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55970","headline":"赠王正己（题拟） · 廖融","name":"赠王正己（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟高鄙俗流，傲逸访巢由。\n古寺寻僧饭，寒岩衣鹿裘。\n园桃山鼠啮，崖蜜猎人偷。\n遂这个清性，浮生不苟求。\n（周本淳校本《诗话总龟》卷二八引《雅言系述》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}